      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "Here is the trap that stops almost everyone. You put in the work for weeks, and nothing visible seems to happen. Effort and results split apart, and you feel completely stuck. So picture an ice cube sitting in a freezing room. Twenty five degrees, twenty six, twenty seven. Still frozen solid. Nothing. Then at thirty two, one more single degree, and suddenly it cracks and begins to melt.",
